# ── Profit Map research system (LYR-187) ──────────────────────────────────────
# Every key here is OPTIONAL. Each one switches on one tier of a cascade, and
# a tier whose key is missing reports `outcome: 'miss'` and hands off to the
# next — so the whole system runs, and is testable, with all four left blank.
# Adding a key later is config, never code. Check src/lib/roi/research/env.ts
# for the single place that reads them.
#
# What still works with nothing set here:
#   S2 job postings — the six ATS APIs are public and unauthenticated, and
#     careers pages are fetched directly. This is the highest-value scout and
#     it needs no key at all.
#   S1 firmographics — falls back to the company's own site: country from the
#     TLD and the footer address, vertical from page metadata. Degraded, not
#     broken (status PARTIAL, confidence low).
#
# What each key buys:
# Fallback fetch ONLY, for sites that block a plain
FIRECRAWL_API_KEY=encrypted:BEotioVGl2sgGLeZ3Si6qk8Zpiv+WVKGsUpGji4STlvMhSfjLMIHmK7M9EgFsX6XZdBMskEHt+nRUToF51dbNgOeGULAcUoTSFlizyydMcHFj3+s25dC/rhWAcQUtorPQj5HGqs82dtOv39SLAkS4uKGhFJ8xWsXRxvOjtD/1FzkbvCW
                             # request or render with JS (GCC firms especially —
                             # altamimi.com 403s a normal fetch). Static sites go
                             # through the artifact cache's own fetch, so the free
                             # tier's 1k credits/month is far more than the POC
                             # needs. Self-hosting is not an option: Firecrawl is
                             # Docker Compose across Playwright + Redis + RabbitMQ
                             # + Postgres, ~8GB RAM, and does not support
                             # serverless — this app is Vercel-only by design.
# People Data Labs. Free tier is 100 company lookups
PDL_API_KEY=encrypted:BKkzBR7BlVeU5d9QdKi0ot1acC+G5XVRFibGbxHCs15FeKCWFerxFEzndt0ZkypJdm51r2i7V7bTjgXeasmawjQHd/mrrjzAUOLtwudAKRJRFZGhbQpBdNRWT67uCwEb8w==
                             # a month and only charges on a successful match.
# Requires an Apollo *Organization* plan — Basic and
                             # Professional cannot call the API at all. Leave
                             # blank unless we're on Organization.
# Enterprise contract only; no self-serve tier.
#
# NEVER add a LinkedIn or Proxycurl key. Proxycurl was shut down in July 2025
# after LinkedIn's federal lawsuit, and we sell to law firms. No path in the
# research system may call LinkedIn.

